Hi Finn,

I had hoped to update on the count-based model in inlabru much sooner, but I am having some issues there as well...
I have inlabru version 2.9.0 and I am following  Random Fields in 2D • inlabru (inlabru-org.github.io) <https://inlabru-org.github.io/inlabru/articles/random_fields_2d.html> to define the random field.
